{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sin Slayers: Meat &amp; Greed</strong> is a cozy idle-mining simulator that quietly runs on your screen. Guide a lone dwarf miner as he digs through the cursed lands beneath the world of Sin Slayers\u2014collecting gems and uncovering the darkness below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig through cursed lands</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chip away at rock\u2014gathering valuable gems buried deep beneath forgotten battlefields and haunted crypts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect gems</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each layer hides new surprises. Use your findings to unlock fresh mining zones, upgrade gear, and keep the dig going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your tools</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard-earned loot on stronger pickaxes, faster digging, and a bigger backpack. The deeper you go, the greater the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle-friendly</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sin Slayers: Meat &amp; Greed runs quietly at the bottom of your screen while you go about your day. Whether you're working, studying, or slaying sins elsewhere, your miner keeps digging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Disclaimer:</i></strong><i> Steam Deck is <strong>not supported by design</strong>. The game may launch, but performance and controls are not optimized for Steam Deck.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Discovered Azurite","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3720590/ff6858994da3fafb8d059e58e2944b600ac28db4.jpg"},{"name":"Discovered Chrysoprase","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3720590/b848194d165c182fa20cf16955726c247c4bb4b6.jpg"},{"name":"Discovered Kyanite","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/i